ot/pulls/113429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T20:20:23Z"},{"id":4108879953,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc706IhR","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4108879953","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T20:21:07Z"},{"id":4108882149,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc706JDl","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4108882149","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T20:21:24Z"},{"id":4108884914,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc706Juy","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4108884914","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T20:21:45Z"},{"id":4109021445,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc706rEF","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?u=cf2cae99ded76de82adad250843b8975e6c8787d&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","login":"tdaven","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4109021445","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T20:39:55Z"},{"id":4109999475,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc70-Z1z","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?u=96b5dc9be2859dca5f31314c87d99a68a21e1576&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","login":"BastiaanOlij","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij"},"body":"Ok, I'm going to approve the work here from my perspective with the following footnotes:\n- I'm basing this mostly on testing the work and it doing what it says on the tin, and seeing a lot of value in supporting this logic\n- From what I can see of the written code, it's well put together and I don't see anything that makes me go \"huh, why did he do that\".\n\nHowever, my understanding of texture streaming is only high level, I'm not familiar with the best practices and whether there is a better way to solve this. That said, from what I understand of it, this looks good.\n\nGoing on feedback given by others who are better informed however, I would be confident if we merge this.\n\nI have some wishes for improvements, but I feel these all are better served as follow up PRs as they do not effect the core implementation. My two main ones are:\n- The ability to either set a radius around the player, or maybe use area nodes or something similar, to trigger texture being fully loaded, and to prevent textures from being unloaded when the object using them are within those spaces. This would prevent popping in textures for high detail objects when a player turns around.\n- Adding key metrics that are live inside of the editor to see the effects of changing the settings in the editor. My suggestion would be to add streaming texture memory, and possibly something like how many actions are actually being taken per second. I'd add them in this dialog:\n\n<img width=\"505\" height=\"371\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdf1fbe0-492d-4cb4-aced-0f458276f735\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4109999475","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T03:56:45Z"},{"id":4110911299,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71B4dD","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?u=cf2cae99ded76de82adad250843b8975e6c8787d&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","login":"tdaven","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4110911299","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T05:04:14Z"},{"id":4110941228,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71B_ws","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?u=cf2cae99ded76de82adad250843b8975e6c8787d&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","login":"tdaven","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113429#pullrequestreview-4110941228","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-15T05:10:09Z"},{"id":4111186947,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71C7wD","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"812e94288801969f9141f901132def9a89441bc6","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"up